--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The desktop simulator links against SDL3 (Simple DirectMedia Layer), which is
distributed under the zlib license.

    https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL

SDL3 is a build-time dependency of the simulator only. It is not part of
HakoniwaOS and is not present in device firmware.
